%!
% Définition PDF/X-3 pour Ghostscript : intention de sortie ISO Coated v2 300% (FOGRA39), papier couché.
/ICCProfile (/usr/share/color/icc/ISOcoated_v2_300_eci.icc) def
[ /GTS_PDFXVersion (PDF/X-3:2002) /Title (Paletto Studio - Flyer A5) /Trapped /False /DOCINFO pdfmark
[ /_objdef {icc_PDFX} /type /stream /OBJ pdfmark
[ {icc_PDFX} << /N 4 >> /PUT pdfmark
[ {icc_PDFX} ICCProfile (r) file /PUT pdfmark
[ /_objdef {OutputIntent_PDFX} /type /dict /OBJ pdfmark
[ {OutputIntent_PDFX} << /Type /OutputIntent /S /GTS_PDFX /OutputCondition (ISO Coated v2 300% (ECI), FOGRA39)
  /Info (Papier couche, offset feuille) /OutputConditionIdentifier (FOGRA39) /RegistryName (http://www.color.org) /DestOutputProfile {icc_PDFX} >> /PUT pdfmark
[ {Catalog} << /OutputIntents [ {OutputIntent_PDFX} ] >> /PUT pdfmark
